// The home-screen widget extension's base configuration (WID-1).
//
// It takes the Flutter build name and number from Generated.xcconfig, the
// same as the app, so both halves carry one version. It is separate from
// Release.xcconfig because release-ios.yml appends the app's signing there
// and the extension needs its own provisioning profile; see docs/RELEASING.md.
#include "Generated.xcconfig"
